  "description": "Overview\n\nVersatile and powerful — the BULLS Iconic EVO 1 750 is built for riders who want a smooth, confident ride on both pavement and light trails. With a sleek frame and robust components, it's perfect for commuting, cruising, and weekend exploring.\n\nMotor and Battery\n\nMotor: Bosch Performance Line CX motor with up to 85 Nm of torque. Delivers powerful acceleration and smooth handling on streets, hills, or trails.\n\nBattery: Bosch PowerTube 750 Wh, fully integrated into the frame. Long range and sleek design with a charging time of approx. 6 hours.\n\nSuspension and Frame\n\nFork: SR Suntour XCM32-DS LOR Coil with 120mm of travel for comfort on uneven roads and trails.\n\nFrame: 6061 aluminum with internal cable routing. Lightweight, durable, and available in multiple sizes (41/44/48/54 cm).\n\nDrivetrain and Brakes\n\nGears: Shimano Deore 10-speed drivetrain for smooth shifting and efficient climbs.\n\nBrakes: Tektro HD-M390 hydraulic disc brakes with 180mm rotors front and rear. Dependable stopping power in all conditions.\n\nWheels and Tires\n\nWheels: 27.5\" wheels for the perfect balance between agility and stability.\n\nTires: Supero All Ground 2.4\" wide tires for grip, comfort, and control on mixed terrain.\n\nAdditional Features\n\nDisplay: LED remote + Kiox 300 display shows your speed, range, assist level, and more—bright and easy to use on the go.\n\nPedals and Saddle: Comes with Wellgo C-098DU pedals and an Iconic SUV saddle for comfort and control.\n\nTechnology and Design\n\nMonkeyLink Ready: Quickly add compatible lights, fenders, and accessories with the built-in MonkeyLink system.\n\nClass-1 eBike: Pedal-assist up to 20 mph—legal and perfect for most city and trail systems.\n\nBottom line: The Iconic EVO 1 750 Diamond is a reliable, all-around eBike built to handle whatever you throw at it—urban commutes, light off-roading, or just joyrides around the neighborhood.",
